        {
            "fieldname": "user_config_html",
            "fieldtype": "HTML",
            "options": "<div style=\"padding:10px;background:#f0f4ff;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #5e64ff;\">\n<h5 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;\">User Print Config</h5>\n<p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:13px;\">Each user can have their own printer configuration. Create a <b>User Print Config</b> for each user to map their specific printers.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:13px;\"><b>Priority:</b> User Print Config &gt; Default config above.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;\"><a href=\"/app/user-print-config\" class=\"btn btn-xs btn-primary\">Manage User Print Configs</a></p>\n</div>"
        },
        {
            "fieldname": "section_break_recommendations",
            "fieldtype": "Section Break",
            "label": "Printer Setup Recommendations",
            "collapsible": 1,
            "collapsible_depends_on": "eval:true"
        },
        {
            "fieldname": "recommendations_html",
            "fieldtype": "HTML",
            "options": "<div style=\"padding:12px;background:#fffdf0;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #f0ad4e;font-size:13px;\">\n<h5 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;\">Network Printer: Brother HL-B2180DW Setup Guide</h5>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:12px;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#f8f8f0;\"><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-weight:bold;width:180px;\">Print Speed</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">34 pages/min (single-side)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-weight:bold;\">Monthly Duty Cycle</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">30,000 pages (max)</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8f8f0;\"><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-weight:bold;\">Recommended Volume</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">2,500 pages/month</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-weight:bold;\">Paper Tray</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">150 sheets (refill every ~150 prints)</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8f8f0;\"><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;font-weight:bold;\">Connectivity</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">USB, Ethernet (LAN), Wi-Fi</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h6 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0;color:#c00;\">MANDATORY: Network Setup</h6>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;\">\n<li><b>Use Ethernet (LAN cable), NOT Wi-Fi</b> \u2014 Wi-Fi drops packets under heavy load (9+ users)</li>\n<li><b>Set Static IP</b> on the printer (e.g. 192.168.1.50) \u2014 DHCP can change IP and break all print configs</li>\n<li><b>Install via TCP/IP port on every PC:</b> Add Printer \u2192 TCP/IP \u2192 enter printer IP (e.g. 192.168.1.50)</li>\n<li><b>Printer name in QZ Tray must match exactly</b> what Windows shows (e.g. \"Brother HL-B2180DW\")</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h6 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0;color:#c00;\">IMPORTANT: High Volume Warning</h6>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>900 prints/day = ~18,000/month = <b>7x recommended volume</b></li>\n<li>Paper tray (150 sheets) needs <b>6 refills per 900 prints</b></li>\n<li>Toner will drain every <b>2-3 weeks</b> at this volume</li>\n<li>Consider upgrading to Brother HL-L6200DW (10,000 rec. monthly) for sustained high volume</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h6 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0;\">QZ Tray Setup (Every PC)</h6>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Install QZ Tray from <b>qz.io</b></li>\n<li>Install Brother printer driver</li>\n<li>Verify printer appears in QZ Tray \u2192 Settings \u2192 Printers tab</li>\n<li>Open User Print Config and click <b>\"Detect Printers\"</b> to verify</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h6 style=\"margin:12px 0 6px 0;\">Typical Setup (Per User)</h6>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12px;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#f0f0f0;\"><th style=\"padding:5px 8px;text-align:left;\">Print Format</th><th style=\"padding:5px 8px;text-align:left;\">Printer</th><th style=\"padding:5px 8px;text-align:left;\">Type</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">80MM Token</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">TSC/TVS (USB local)</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">Local thermal per user</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#f8f8f0;\"><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">A4 Invoice</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">Brother HL-B2180DW</td><td style=\"padding:5px 8px;\">Network shared (LAN)</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>"
        }
